# Pagination (Very Important)

Every company uses pagination.

Imagine:

```text
10,00,000 Students
```

Should API return everything?

❌ No

---

Instead:

```http
/students?page=1&limit=10
```

---

FastAPI

```python
@app.get("/students")
def students(
    page: int = 1,
    limit: int = 10
):
    return {
        "page": page,
        "limit": limit
    }
```

---

Request

```http
/students?page=2&limit=20
```

Response

```json
{
  "page":2,
  "limit":20
}
```

---

